---
import BaseLayout from 'theme/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from 'theme/components/Hero.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from 'theme/components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import CostTable from 'theme/components/CostTable.astro';
import CTABand from 'theme/components/CTABand.astro';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', item: '/' },
  { name: 'Moving Guides', item: '/moving-guides/' },
  { name: 'How Much Do Removals Cost in the UK?', item: '/moving-guides/how-much-do-removals-cost-uk/' }
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How Much Do Removals Cost in the UK? | 2026 Average Price Guide"
  description="UK removal costs explained. Average prices for 1 to 5-bed houses, hourly man and van rates, packing service costs, and money-saving moving tips."
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
>
  <Hero
    variant="blog"
    title="How Much Do Removals Cost in the UK? (2026 Breakdown)"
    subtitle="An independent, transparent breakdown of house removal costs across Birmingham and the wider UK."
    badge="Pricing & Budgeting"
    author="Jimmys Removals Pricing Team"
    date="19 September 2026"
    readingTimeText="8 min read"
  />

  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-8 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">
    <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />

    <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed">
      <p class="text-lg font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        Budgeting for a house move is critical to avoiding unexpected completion day expenses. On average, UK house removals range between £280 for a 1-bed flat to over £1,450 for a 4-bed detached home on a typical 10 to 50-mile journey.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">UK Average Costs by Property Size</h2>
      <p>
        Removal costs depend heavily on the volume of belongings (cubic feet), travel distance, and access conditions:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>1-Bed Flat:</strong> £280 – £380 (Local) / £550 – £700 (Long Distance 150mi)</li>
        <li><strong>2-Bed House:</strong> £390 – £540 (Local) / £750 – £950 (Long Distance 150mi)</li>
        <li><strong>3-Bed House:</strong> £560 – £850 (Local) / £1,050 – £1,400 (Long Distance 150mi)</li>
        <li><strong>4-Bed House:</strong> £780 – £1,150 (Local) / £1,450 – £1,950 (Long Distance 150mi)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Hourly Rates vs Fixed Quotes</h2>
      <p>
        Man and van services typically charge £65 to £85 per hour for a 3.5T Luton van with 1–2 movers. For full family moves involving property chains, fixed quotes protect against costly waiting time charges while awaiting solicitor key releases.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Embedded Crawlable Cost Table Component -->
    <CostTable />

    <CTABand
      heading="Calculate Your Exact Removal Price"
      subheading="Use our fast quote tool to receive an itemised, binding quote tailored to your inventory."
      primaryCtaText="Get a Free Quote"
      primaryCtaHref="/get-a-quote/"
    />
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
